# The chain the conformance tests check the filter against: its protos (every
# grpc-gateway binding and request message), its go.mod (the SDK version,
# whose protos come from the module cache, and the CometBFT and grpc-gateway
# versions this module must require), its genesis (the block size and gas the
# answer ceilings are sized against) and app/resultcap (the result caps they
# are sized against). fetch-chain.sh materialises exactly this
# commit into .chain/; the tests refuse any other.
#
# Bump it with every chain release this deployment runs, then run
# ./fetch-chain.sh && go test ./... here. A failure is a drift between the
# filter's allowlist and what the node now serves: fix the filter in the same
# change as the bump.
repo=https://github.com/zenopie/earth-network-chain.git
commit=991a6472f5e20304cd9a67e00c4ee1c9ab3a4a29
